      "problemHtml": "<p>You split a network with the given prefix into AT LEAST the given number of equal subnets. Give the number of borrowed bits, the new prefix and the usable hosts per subnet.</p><p><i>This set has 1 table. There is nothing to run: answer in the panel on the right and press Submit. The questions follow the style of the NWC204 final exam, so work them out on paper first, exactly as you would in the exam hall.</i></p>\n<h4>Requirements</h4>\n<ul>\n  <li>Answer every question in the answer panel, then press <b>Submit</b>.</li>\n  <li>All answers must be correct to get <b>Accepted</b>; the explanations appear after you submit.</li>\n</ul>",
